    "Gideon": {
      "x": 439.0,
      "z": 2913.5,
      "source_px": [
        569,
        821
      ],
      "tier": "town",
      "region": "Blackwood",
      "identity": "The control group. The most Imperial place in Argonia: timber, tilled fields, a proper inn, a chapel, a market cross. It looks like Cyrodiil, and that is the point - it is the one screenshot in this game that COULD be another game, placed deliberately so the other twelve regions can be measured against it. Industry: timber, grain, road tolls. Tension: an Imperial county in all but name, worked by Argonians who are not paid. Layout tells you: a square with a cross in it - somebody imported a plan.",
      "nearest_neighbour": "Helstrom",
      "nn_road_m": 2378,
      "nn_walk_min": 19.8,
      "nn_jog_min": 12.4,
