    "Helstrom": {
      "x": 2262.5,
      "z": 2773.5,
      "source_px": [
        1090,
        781
      ],
      "tier": "capital",
      "region": "The Stone Forest",
      "identity": "The throne that was never Imperial. Helstrom is grown into and around the greatest Hist in Argonia; the 'palace' is a hollowed bole and there is no chair in it, only a root you kneel at. Industry: it is the hub of the root-network, so every road and every travel route ends here. Tension: Hist-speakers vs. nationalists vs. a small Imperial legation everyone tolerates and nobody obeys. Layout tells you: the streets are root-radial, all leading inward to the tree - whoever runs this town, it is not a person.",
      "nearest_neighbour": "Gideon",
      "nn_road_m": 2378,
