      "z": 3823.5,
      "source_px": [
        1525,
        1081
      ],
      "tier": "town",
      "region": "Crimson Coast",
      "identity": "The dye town. The crimson tide-lichen is harvested, boiled and sold to the Empire as imperial purple, and everything and everyone here is stained. Industry: clay and dye. Tension: the dye is killing the harvesters and the guild denies it, in writing, repeatedly. Layout tells you: the vats are at the centre and the housing is downwind - somebody ranked the vats above the people.",
