    "Lilmoth": {
      "x": 2766.5,
      "z": 5027.5,
      "source_px": [
        1234,
        1425
      ],
      "tier": "city",
      "region": "Western Rootlands",
      "identity": "The great rotting port. Two cities stacked: Imperial colonial stone sunk to its first-floor windows, and an Argonian stilt-slum built on top of the drowned storeys. Industry: shipping, smuggling, moon-sugar transhipment, the egg black market. Tension: the city loses a hand's width a year and the Imperial families will not say so. Layout tells you: the rich live LOW in wet stone because status is masonry, and the poor live DRY above them - the whole social order is upside down and visible from the harbour.",
      "nearest_neighbour": "Blackrose",
      "nn_road_m": 1503,
